{
	"nodes":[
		{
			"id":"151957b1761d0ef1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"第10章 -- 子查詢",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-380,
			"y":-300,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"baa040b4b9a86b05",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"沒辦法一次找到資料，要2次以上的查詢，用子查詢，（）裏面的就叫子查詢",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-380,
			"y":-200,
			"width":260,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"5644da80a942dd74",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"例如：要找人口數比美國多的國家有哪些",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":80,
			"y":-200,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"67c80c3a9e4f0da3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"先查美國有多少人",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":80,
			"y":-100,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"dbe5982d7cfb0fbe",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"再查全球人口，給條件篩選人口數大於美國的國家",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":80,
			"y":0,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"82cff2772bdb6853",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"語法ALL是AND的意思，SOME跟ANY一樣的作用，為什麽有兩個？因為新舊版本的問題，舊版用SOME，新版用ANY",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-380,
			"y":140,
			"width":260,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"f306bf4f6607df57",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"把兩個查詢合併在一起的方法",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-380,
			"y":-70,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"68c00bd4a9932e43",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"SELECT NAME,GNP FROM (SELECT * FROM WORLD.COUNTRY WHERE CONTINENT='ASIA') AS ASIACOUNTRY\n (SELECT * FROM WORLD.COUNTRY WHERE CONTINENT='ASIA')只是一個結果集，如果沒有AS ASIACOUNTRY無法顯示，會出錯\n FROM後面一定要加AS“資料表”或VIEW",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-380,
			"y":380,
			"width":960,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"07fd1cab55e30a5e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"子查詢一定要先測試能不能用，可以再繼續往下寫",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-380,
			"y":560,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"2c49f502bb186121",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"CREATE TABLE WORLD.NEWCOUNTRY SELECT CODE,NAME,CONTINENT,REGION,POPULATION,GNP FROM WORLD.COUNTRY WHERE 1=0;\nWHERE 1=0讓資料在複製的時候只複製欄位不複製資料，前面的敘述是寫要複製的欄位名稱",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-380,
			"y":680,
			"width":960,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"15f7a8733061249e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"local instance每個資料庫資料表都是獨立的，無法在這個頁面做關聯",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-380,
			"y":1060,
			"width":960,
			"height":60
		},
		{"id":"236fd565a618955e","type":"file","file":"Pasted image 20260914142217.png","x":-380,"y":1300,"width":300,"height":400},
		{
			"id":"d9715ec935242c3b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"restrict （一般的修改是受限制的）",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-380,
			"y":1220,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"dc9560730dd78491",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"關聯性/一致性/正確性",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":20,
			"y":1220,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"f61fc357ec0c00aa",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"設計資料庫資料表都要事先規劃，要先做正規化",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-380,
			"y":1800,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"13a73b32d55620fc",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"SET的位置表示方式\nINSERT INTO SETTABLE VALUES(1)\n第一個：2⁰；第二個：2¹；第三個：2²；第四個：2³，以此類推",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-380,
			"y":1920,
			"width":500,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"2ce700c8b85b9e80",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"SET的位置表示方式\nINSERT INTO SETTABLE VALUES(21)\n要拆解21= 1 + 4 + 16\n所以寫入的內容會是：第一個+第三個+第五個",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-380,
			"y":2060,
			"width":920,
			"height":100
		},
		{"id":"e724bd11275d59df","type":"file","file":"Pasted image 20260914155106.png","x":-380,"y":2320,"width":400,"height":135},
		{
			"id":"f4ffce56172e9dbe",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"ci代表不分大小寫",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-380,
			"y":2240,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"e367566e1cae934d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"cs代表要分大小寫",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-380,
			"y":2500,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{"id":"526daaf4cb8ff8e2","type":"file","file":"Pasted image 20260914155210.png","x":-380,"y":2580,"width":400,"height":141}
	],
